{
    "Directions": "Read this poem. Then answer each question that follows.",
    "Context": [],
    "Title": "The North Wind and the Sun",
    "Subtitle": "",
    "Author": "by Mary Ann Hoberman",
    "LabelType": "L",
    "Content": [
        [" ", "I'm the North Wind."],
        [" ", "I am cold. I am strong."],
        [" ", "No one can beat me"],
        [" ", "When I come along.\n\n"],
        ["5", "\tI am the Sun."],
        [" ", "\tI am gentle and warm."],
        [" ", "\tThat gives me more power"],
        [" ", "\tThan coldness or storm.\n\n"],
        [" ", "Silly old Sun,"],
        ["10", "You are not very bright!"],
        [" ", "Let's have a contest"],
        [" ", "To see who is right.\n\n"],
        [" ", "\tLook down below,"],
        [" ", "\tAt that bundled-up man."],
        ["15", "\tMake him take off his coat"],
        [" ", "\tIf you can.\n\n"],
        [" ", "Of course I can do that!"],
        [" ", "I'll raise up a squall"],
        [" ", "And blow off his coat"],
        ["20", "With no trouble at all.\n\n"],
        [" ", "\tThe more that you blow, Wind,"],
        [" ", "\tAnd show off your might,"],
        [" ", "\tThe more the man shivers"],
        [" ", "\tAnd pulls his coat tight."],
        [" ", ":box:shivers = shakes because of being cold"],
        ["25", "Well you go and try"],
        [" ", "Since you think you're so hot!"],
        [" ", "But if I can't do it,"],
        [" ", "You surely cannot.\n\n"],
        [" ", "\tI'll come out right now"],
        ["30", "\tFrom behind this big cloud"],
        [" ", "\tAnd warm the man up."],
        [" ", "\tLook! He's laughing out loud!\n\n"],
        [" ", "So what if he's laughing"],
        [" ", "And you're shining bright!"],
        ["35", "He's still got his coat on."],
        [" ", "It's still pulled up tight.\n\n"],
        [" ", "\tBut look at him now!"],
        [" ", "\tThough I don't want to gloat,"],
        [" ", "\tI have made him so hot,"],
        ["40", "\tHe's unbuttoned his coat!"],
        [" ", ":box:gloat = brag"],
        [" ", "He has taken it off!"],
        [" ", "You have beaten me, Sun!\n\n"],
        [" ", "\tSo I have, silly Wind!"],
        [" ", "\tYou have lost! I have won!"]
    ],
